    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マヤノトップガン",
            "enName": "Mayano Top Gun",
            "jpText": "ブライアンさん、お誕生日おめでと！\r\nねねっ、プレゼントはなにが欲しい～？",
            "enText": "Brian, happy birthday! Hey, so what kinda \npresent do you want?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 2069273130379111305,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……別にいらん。",
            "enText": "…I don't need one.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -1194346096741579802,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マヤノトップガン",
            "enName": "Mayano Top Gun",
            "jpText": "ん～、もしかして今欲しいものがないの？\r\nわかった、じゃあ明日10時に駅に集合ね。\nマヤがお出かけ中に選んであげるっ♪",
            "enText": "Hmm, so there's nothing you want right now? \nOkay then, we'll meet at the station tomorrow, \nten o'clock. We can go shopping for your \npresent together♪",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 2461918495964080612,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "私の予定を勝手に決めるな。",
            "enText": "You don't get to make plans for me.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -5742901614942442420,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヒシアマゾン",
            "enName": "Hishi Amazon",
            "jpText": "お。じゃあアタシもそれに便乗していいかい？\r\nメシ代はおごってやるからさ。",
            "enText": "Oh, mind if I tag along then? \nI'll treat ya to lunch.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -7646949089226327562,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "ったく、アマさんまで……。\r\n出かけたいんならアンタら2人で――",
            "enText": "Ugh, not you too, Ama… If you two \nwanna hang out, just go by yours—",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 3769009620009327003,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヒシアマゾン",
            "enName": "Hishi Amazon",
            "jpText": "ランチは最近できたステーキ屋にしようか！\r\n噛めば噛むほど肉汁が滴る\n赤身肉が美味いらしくてね。",
            "enText": "We could grab lunch at that new steak place! \nFrom what I hear, the way they cook the meat, \nit just gets juicier and juicier with each bite.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -494334071582523177,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……。",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -615320081740371794,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マヤノトップガン",
            "enName": "Mayano Top Gun",
            "jpText": "あ。今すっごく食べたそうな顔した～☆\r\n明日の予定は決ーまりっ。ユー・コピー？",
            "enText": "Ah, you looked like you really wanted to eat \nthat steak just now☆ That settles tomorrow's\nplans, then. You copy?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 3052647797902297797,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……チッ。",
            "enText": "<i>Tch…</i>",
